@startuml
title v1.6 Source-Aware Unified Conversation
actor Lecturer
participant UI
participant "Conversation Engine" as CE
participant "Institutional Retrieval" as IR
participant "External Source Discovery" as ES
participant "Model Router" as MR
participant "Citation Integrity Guard" as CIG
Lecturer -> UI: Ask request + attach uploaded versions
UI -> CE: One conversation message
CE -> IR: Retrieve authorised versioned excerpts
CE -> ES: Retrieve external metadata when needed
CE -> MR: Generic task prompt + verified source pack
MR --> CE: Draft with source markers
CE -> CIG: Remove unknown markers/links/DOIs
CE --> UI: Inline output + institutional/external source cards
@enduml
